    "description": {
      "value": "<p>At the start of each of the Abomination's turns, roll 1d6:<br>1 — every creature within 6 squares takes 2d6 kinetic damage (reality hiccups).<br>2 — every creature within 6 squares rolls Body vs DC 18 or is flung 6 squares in a random direction.<br>3 — the Abomination regains 15 Integrity.<br>4 — all active manifestations within 12 squares are suppressed until its next turn.<br>5 — gravity forgets its job in a 6-square radius: flying, floating, falling upward, GM narrates.<br>6 — the Abomination takes an extra action this turn.</p>",
      "chat": ""
    }
  },
